From 05fa32372f42d93fc5ffb055a86988798ccf5e12 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Minkovsky <dminkovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 02:54:48 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 01/13] Seed the config store with a plain read of the config

Both apps read the config at open by taking the first value of its live
query and cancelling it. The bridge now gives a plain read, get_config,
and both apps seed their config store with it. The first-value helpers
had no other caller and go too.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
