From 84542048e177e83b715e5162374913f9a0f97866 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Minkovsky <dminkovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 11:44:14 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 11/13] Read the media session's up-next list in one query

Android's media session built its playlist by joining Up Next with the
loaded head of the context lane's list, stopping at the first row not yet
read. One live query now returns the list whole: Up Next, then the lane's
tracks after the playing one in the order it reads in, at most 100, each
part walked on its index. The context lane's list is now read only while
the queue screen shows it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
